    "summary": "After an enemy destroys your **ASTRA MILITARUM INFANTRY REGIMENT** during its [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) or either [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), you may target the destroyed unit. **ARTILLERY** and **CHARACTER** units are excluded. Roll a D6. On 3+, put a [Cult Ambush](vsdata:ability/genestealer-cults.cult-ambush) marker more than 8\" from each enemy unit if there is space. Either way on a success, add a copy of the unit to [Cult Ambush](vsdata:ability/genestealer-cults.cult-ambush) at full Starting Strength and wounds, with its [**[ONE SHOT](vsdata:weapon-ability/one-shot)**] weapons unfired. Once per battle.",
